SpringCabal Games @VERSION@
===========================

Seven Ludum Dare games made by SpringCabal, playable from one menu. Each game
comes in two versions: a WebAssembly port and the original Lua release.

  Gravitas             Ludum Dare 32  (Apr 2015)
  Zeus vs Bunnies      Ludum Dare 33 warmup  (Aug 2015)
  Area 17              Ludum Dare 33  (Aug 2015)
  Flove                Ludum Dare 34  (Dec 2015)
  Parts Needed         Ludum Dare 35  (Apr 2016)
  My Cube              Ludum Dare 42  (Aug 2018)
  To the Last Drop     Ludum Dare 43  (Dec 2018)

Running
-------

Start @LAUNCHER@

The menu shows the credits for each game. Up/Down picks a game, Left/Right
picks a version, and Enter launches it.

This folder is self-contained: settings, logs (infolog.txt) and caches are
written here, not to your home directory.

Engine
------

Recoil (Spring RTS fork), experimental build @ENGINE@.
The engine is licensed under the GPL; see the files in doc/ and the license
files that came with it. Game content belongs to its respective authors.
